WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:32.880
Papa?

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.800
Belle, you must leave here. This castle is alive.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.580
Who’s there?

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.740
Do you wish to take your father’s place?

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.140
Come into the light.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.820
Show me the girl.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.460
Look at her! What if she is the one? The one who’d break the spell!

00:00:58.880 --> 00:00:59.560
Hello!

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.660
You can talk?!

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.700
Belle, of course, he can talk!

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:04.880
Hello, pleased to meet you!

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.840
The master is not as terrible as he appears.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.820
I say we kill the beast!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.740
Think of the one thing you’ve always wanted.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:30.740
Now find it in your mind’s eye and feel it in your heart.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:35.960
No!!

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.480
Don’t be afraid.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.820
I’m not afraid.

